dsh-plugin-garmin-connect README · Print the local link without opening the system browser:：garmin-connect-workspace open --no-open
```

The command opens the system browser by default. The page uses the same account
IDs, Garmin sessions, timeline data and SQLite notes as Harness for the selected
workspace. Add an account with a free-form account note and **“请输入这个账号的邮箱”**json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "garmin": {
      "command": "garmin-connect-mcp",
      "args": ["--workspace"]
    }
  }
}
```

